@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-03, FR-08, FR-09
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/pages/TeacherUpload.jsx, frontend/focus-flow/src/services/videoUpload.js, backend/src/routes/video.routes.js, backend/src/services/videoBatch.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 multipart batch API、部分成功與 executor mode 重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 教師建立影片批次循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "教師／管理員" as Manager
participant "TeacherUpload" as UploadPage
participant "uploadCourseVideos()" as UploadClient
participant "VideoBatchController" as BatchController
participant "VideoBatchService" as BatchService
participant "CourseAccessService" as AccessService
database "VideoBatch model" as BatchModel
participant "VideoService" as VideoService
database "Video model" as VideoModel
participant "VideoProcessingQueue／\nVideoBatchProcessingService" as Scheduler

Manager -> UploadPage : 選擇 1～10 個影片並送出
UploadPage -> UploadClient : uploadCourseVideos(courseId, items)
UploadClient -> BatchController : POST /courses/{courseId}/video-batches\nmultipart videos + titles
BatchController -> BatchService : createVideoBatch({ courseId, files, titles, user })
BatchService -> AccessService : getCourseByIdOrThrow()\nassertCanManageCourse()
AccessService --> BatchService : 可管理 Course
BatchService -> BatchModel : create(status=creating, processingMode)

loop 每個檔案
  BatchService -> VideoService : createCourseVideo(..., deferProcessingStart)
  VideoService -> VideoModel : 檢查同課程 fileHash 後 create\nprocessing.status=queued
  alt 建立成功
    VideoModel --> VideoService : Video
    VideoService --> BatchService : uploaded item
  else 重複或單檔驗證失敗
    VideoService --> BatchService : safe item error
    BatchService -> BatchService : 清理該失敗暫存檔
  end
  BatchService -> BatchModel : findOneAndUpdate(items, status=processing)
end

alt VIDEO_BATCH_PIPELINE_ENABLED = true
  BatchService -> Scheduler : scheduleVideoBatchProcessing(batchId, uploadedItems)
else false（預設 single_adapter）
  note over VideoService,Scheduler
    每支成功建立的 Video 已由既有單支 queue 個別排程；
    這不是通用 backend batch worker。
  end note
end

BatchService -> BatchService : syncBatchStatus()\n計算 completed／failed／processing
BatchService --> BatchController : durable batch presentation
BatchController --> UploadClient : 201 { batchId, counts, items[] }
UploadClient --> UploadPage : 保存逐檔狀態並允許重新整理後追蹤
UploadPage --> Manager : 顯示成功、失敗與處理中項目

note over BatchService,BatchModel
  單一檔案失敗不回滾其他成功影片；VideoBatch 是 API aggregate，
  每支影片仍沿用 Video processing lifecycle。
end note

@enduml
